{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14082","headline":"秋中雨田园即事 · 耿湋","name":"秋中雨田园即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠重云暗，萧萧密雨垂。\n爲霖淹古道，积日满荒陂。\n五稼何时获，孤村几户炊。\n乱流发通圃，腐叶着秋枝。\n暮爨新樵湿，晨渔旧浦移。\n空余去年菊，花发在东篱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}